42\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202 Dynamic         \342\224\202       \342\224\202 Honeypot        \342\224\202 \342\224\202 Context Memory  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202 Parameter       \342\224\202       \342\224\202 Interrogation   \342\224\202 \342\224\202 Wipe & Reset    \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202 Redaction       \342\224\202       \342\224\202 Sandbox         \342\224\202 \342\224\202 Protocol        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230 \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n```\\n\\n### Core Server & Client Modules\\n1. `server/cascadeProxy.ts`: The three-tier interceptor pipeline with Tier 1 regex/IP rules, Tier 2 vector similarity matcher, and Tier 3 Groq/Gemini evaluator.\\n2. `server/interceptionMechanics.ts`: Dynamic parameter redaction algorithms, synthetic Honeypot sandbox state, and agent context-wiping routine.\\n3. `server/storageManager.ts`: Abstraction representing the 5 TB Google AI Pro high-capacity storage environment with immutable audit logs and vector cache persistence.\\n4. `server/policyCompiler.ts`: Compiles UI policy toggle flags into dynamic regex rules and Tier 3 Overseer system instructions.\\n5. `src/components/PolicyToggles.tsx`: The requested React component with no-code switches, compiled prompt preview, and instant policy sync.\\n6. `src/components/ThreatTelemetry.tsx`: Visual analytics with attack vector heatmaps, tier distribution graphs, and latency reduction metrics.\\n7. `src/components/AttackSimulator.tsx`: Live playground to trigger exploits and trace cascade proxy actions in real time.\\n8. `src/components/AuditLogDrawer.tsx`: Detailed payload inspector and forensic log viewer.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Verification & Testing Plan\\n\\n1. **Compilation & Linting**: Run `compile_applet` to verify TypeScript compliance across all server and React components.\\n2. **Cascade Tier Verification**:\\n   - Test Tier 1 with `rm -rf /` $\\\\rightarrow$ must block in $< 1\\\\text{ms}$ with zero model call.\\n   - Test Tier 2 with repeat or slightly varied blocked intent $\\\\rightarrow$ must hit vector cache ($>98\\\\%$ match) in $\\\\approx 5\\\\text{ms}$.\\n   - Test Tier 3 with parameter pollution $\\\\rightarrow$ verify surgical redaction and safe execution.\\n   - Test Tier 3 with spec gaming $\\\\rightarrow$ verify silent diversion to synthetic honeypot.\\n   - Test exploit detection $\\\\rightarrow$ verify primary agent context memory wipe.\\n3. **UI Reactivity**: Verify no-code policy toggles update the compiled Overseer instructions live and immediate test attacks reflect new policies.\", \"Description\":\"Create implementation plan for WATCHDOGS AI Runtime Security Monitor\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\".aistudio/artifacts/brain/3a56b349-9b77-4fb5-b664-e481331aee3c/implementation_plan.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing implementation plan\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create implementation plan artifact\"}"
