            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### What It Does"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "WATCHDOGS operates as an intelligent intercepting reverse-proxy between an autonomous AI agent (e.g. LangChain / Gemini agent) and its execution environment (tools, shell, database, APIs). Instead of routing every single agent tool call to an expensive, high-latency LLM evaluator, WATCHDOGS cascades requests through three distinct filtering tiers:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Tier 1 \342\200\224 Zero-Latency Heuristics Engine**: Intercepts regex patterns for catastrophic commands (`rm -rf`, `chmod 777`, fork bombs, unauthorized IP egress, SQL injections) in `< 1ms`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Tier 2 \342\200\224 Semantic Vector Cache**: Queries an indexed vector store of previously evaluated and blocked intents backed by the 5 TB Google AI Pro persistent storage abstraction. Matches with $>98\\%$ cosine similarity are immediately blocked or quarantined in $\\approx 5\\text{ms}$ with zero model inference cost."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Tier 3 \342\200\224 Groq / Gemini Overseer**: Deep semantic reasoning for ambiguous, novel agent intents. Returns granular remediation decisions beyond simple block/allow:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Dynamic Parameter Redaction**: Strips malicious arguments while allowing safe tool calls to proceed without disruption."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Honeypot Interrogation Mode**: Silently diverts deceptive agents to synthetic decoy sandboxes with fake credentials to study attack patterns."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Contextual Memory Wipe**: Purges compromised agent context windows upon exploit discovery and restarts clean states with protective constraints."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
