              text: "> - **Interactive Threat Simulator**: A built-in Security Testing Console with real-world attack vectors (destructive shell commands, PII harvesting, speculative prompt injections, parameter pollution, spec gaming) to trigger and visualize the 3-tier cascade and interception mechanics live."
