  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Frontend Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focused on building out the React frontend components. I\'ve begun reviewing the required features, and the first component I\'m tackling is the `TopBar.tsx`. I\'m breaking down the components, and considering how the Top Bar contract elements will map into this React component. I am thinking through the structure and design of the Top Bar, including the layout of the wordmark and the icons.\n\n\n**Building Policy Toggles**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the policy toggle UI elements. The design will feature clean, interactive toggle cards linked to instant API updates. I\'m focusing on \"Block PII Extraction\" and \"Enforce Read-Only File Access\" toggles, which will update the system prompt in real-time. I\'m working on the syntax-highlighted Overseer System Prompt preview, too, as an important element of the design. Next I\'ll start focusing on the `ThreatTelemetry.tsx` component.\n\n\n**Designing Attack Simulator**\n\nNow, I\'m concentrating on the `AttackSimulator.tsx` component. I\'m prioritizing the interactive attack payloads, specifically the destructive shell and unauthorized IP egress scenarios, to provide immediate testing of Tier 1 heuristics and IP filters. I\'ll include the custom payload builder and cascade trace visualizer for deeper analysis. I\'m building out a series of pre-configured attack payloads to test for specific triggers.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1054348"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { ShieldAlert, ShieldCheck, Zap } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface TopBarProps {\\n  activeTab: string;\\n  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void;\\n  systemHealthy: boolean;\\n  onEmergencyWipe: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const TopBar: React.FC<TopBarProps> = ({\\n  activeTab,\\n  setActiveTab,\\n  systemHealthy,\\n  onEmergencyWipe,\\n}) => {\\n  const navItems = [\\n    { id: \'telemetry\', label: \'Telemetry & Heatmaps\' },\\n    { id: \'policies\', label: \'Policy Studio\' },\\n    { id: \'simulator\', label: \'Attack Simulator\' },\\n    { id: \'audit\', label: \'Immutable Audit Logs\' },\\n    { id: \'honeypot\', label: \'Honeypot Sandbox\' },\\n    { id: \'integration\', label: \'Agent SDK\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#070b12] sticky top-0 z-40\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-8\\\">\\n        {/* Zone 1: Brand wordmark */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400\\\">\\n            <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-sans uppercase\\\">\\n              WATCHDOGS\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 ml-2 hidden sm:inline\\\">\\n              Runtime Security Proxy\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: Navigation Links */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium\\\">\\n          {navItems.map((item) => {\\n            const isActive = activeTab === item.id;\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={item.id}\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(item.id)}\\n                className={`transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer pb-1 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'text-emerald-400 border-b-2 border-emerald-400 font-semibold\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {item.label}\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Primary Action */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onEmergencyWipe}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-rose-500/15 border border-rose-500/40 text-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-500/25 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Forcefully purge primary agent short-term context memory\\\"\\n          >\\n            <ShieldAlert className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-400\\\" />\\n            <span>Emergency Context Wipe</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create top navigation bar following Top Bar Contract\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/TopBar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing TopBar component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/TopBar.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
