    thinking: "**Defining Export Specifications**\n\nI am now delving into the precise specifications of the export function, focusing on SOC 2 and EU AI Act compliance. Specifically, I\'m defining the requirements for machine-readable JSON or CSV outputs, integrating SHA-256 integrity verification, and considering how best to structure headers. I need to make sure all critical aspects of the data are covered.\n\n\n**Establishing Export Endpoint**\n\nI\'ve finalized the API endpoint and export utility design. The `GET /api/audit-logs/export` endpoint will output compliance-ready documents. The structure now includes detailed header metadata for both SOC 2 and EU AI Act, encompassing timestamps, record counts, and cryptographic integrity measures like Merkle roots and SHA-256 hashes. The focus is on secure, machine-readable JSON or CSV outputs, integrating per-row integrity checks.\n\n\n"
