    thinking: "**Developing Export Capabilities**\n\nI\'m focusing on enhancing `src/components/AuditLogViewer.tsx`. My current thought process centers around enabling users to export machine-readable JSON with a SHA-256 integrity manifest envelope, along with RFC 4180 CSV exports that include SHA-256 verification header lines. I\'m also considering allowing users to view the SHA-256 Merkle Root and SOC.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_453721"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Upgrade export handlers to fetch compliance-verified JSON and CSV with SHA-256 headers\", \"EndLine\":85, \"Instruction\":\"Provide both JSON and CSV compliance export options with manifest details\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const handleExport = async (format: \'json\' | \'csv\') => {\\n    try {\\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/audit-logs/export?format=${format}`);\\n      const content = await res.text();\\n      const mimeType = format === \'csv\' ? \'text/csv\' : \'application/json\';\\n      const ext = format === \'csv\' ? \'csv\' : \'json\';\\n      const blob = new Blob([content], { type: `${mimeType};charset=utf-8` });\\n      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\\n      const downloadAnchor = document.createElement(\'a\');\\n      downloadAnchor.setAttribute(\'href\', url);\\n      downloadAnchor.setAttribute(\'download\', `watchdogs_soc2_compliance_audit_${Date.now()}.${ext}`);\\n      document.body.appendChild(downloadAnchor);\\n      downloadAnchor.click();\\n      downloadAnchor.remove();\\n      URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.error(\'Failed to export compliance logs:\', err);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"space-y-5\\\">\\n      {/* Header & Filter Controls */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h2 className=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <Hash className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n            SHA-256 Immutable Audit Ledger\\n          </h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n            Cryptographically chained security records stored in the 5 TB Google AI Pro persistent environment.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => handleExport(\'json\')}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/15 hover:bg-emerald-500/25 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Download machine-readable JSON with Merkle Root SHA-256 verification envelope\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n            <span>Export SOC 2 JSON</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => handleExport(\'csv\')}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Download RFC 4180 CSV with SHA-256 header manifest\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n            <span>Export CSV</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\", \"StartLine\":47, \"TargetContent\":\"  const handleExportJson = () => {\\n    const dataStr = \'data:text/json;charset=utf-8,\' + encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify(logs, null, 2));\\n    const downloadAnchor = document.createElement(\'a\');\\n    downloadAnchor.setAttribute(\'href\', dataStr);\\n    downloadAnchor.setAttribute(\'download\', `watchdogs_immutable_audit_${Date.now()}.json`);\\n    document.body.appendChild(downloadAnchor);\\n    downloadAnchor.click();\\n    downloadAnchor.remove();\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"space-y-5\\\">\\n      {/* Header & Filter Controls */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h2 className=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <Hash className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n            SHA-256 Immutable Audit Ledger\\n          </h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n            Cryptographically chained security records stored in the 5 TB Google AI Pro persistent environment.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={handleExportJson}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n            <span>Export Compliance Ledger (JSON)</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AuditLogViewer.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating AuditLogViewer export buttons\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update export buttons in AuditLogViewer.tsx\"}"
